# SariTrack Cursor AI Rules
# Follow the master standards in AGENTS.md

- Always read AGENTS.md and docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md before modifying code.
- Never commit directly to main; use feature branches (feat/*, fix/*, chore/*, test/*).
- Maintain Vertical Slice Architecture (backend, web, mobile under feature/<name>).
- Respect multi-tenancy: always filter queries by vendor_id.
- Never commit hardcoded secrets; use environment variables or application-local.properties.
- Before committing, verify tests:
  - Backend: cd backend && ./mvnw test
  - Web: cd web && npx vitest run
  - Mobile: cd mobile && .\gradlew.bat testDebugUnitTest
- Follow Conventional Commits: <type>(<scope>): <subject>
